ates and your external resource policy. Turn external icon loading off or restore the previous appearance if icons or messages are unsuitable; check that buttons remain understandable.', 'guide' => 'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-wishlist/#booster-v10-s19-wishlist-icons', 'routes' => array( 'free' => array( 'admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&wcj-cat=cart_and_checkout&section=wishlist&active_tab=wcj_wishlist_single_general_tab' ), 'plus' => array( 'admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&wcj-cat=cart_and_checkout&section=wishlist&active_tab=wcj_wishlist_single_general_tab' ), 'elite' => array( 'admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&wcj-cat=cart_and_checkout&section=wishlist&active_tab=wcj_wishlist_single_general_tab' ) ), 'members' => array( 'free' => array( 'Add/Remove font awesome icon css', 'Add to wishlist icon color (Elite only)', 'Added to wishlist icon color (Elite only)', 'FadeIn/FadeOut add/remove wishlist message (Elite only)' ), 'plus' => array( 'Add/Remove font awesome icon css', 'Add to wishlist icon color (Elite only)', 'Added to wishlist icon color (Elite only)', 'FadeIn/FadeOut add/remove wishlist message (Elite only)' ), 'elite' => array( 'Add/Remove font awesome icon css', 'Add to wishlist icon color', 'Added to wishlist icon color', 'FadeIn/FadeOut add/remove wishlist message' ) ), 'placement' => 'settings', 'member_keys' => array( 'wcj_wishlist_enabled_font_awesome', 'wcj_add_wishlist_icon_color', 'wcj_added_wishlist_icon_color', 'wcj_wishlist_enabled_msg_fadeinout' ) ), array( 'module' => 'wishlist', 'group' => 'wishlist--customer-list', 'anchor' => 'booster-v10-s19-wishlist-customer-list', 'label' => 'Understand saved items', 'consequence' => 'Guest lists use a browser cookie; signed-in lists use the customer account. The wishlist table offers Remove and Add to cart, or Select options for products that need a choice.', 'context' => 'Check the guest and signed-in lists separately; do not assume they merge. Removing an item changes that list; Add to cart changes the cart separately. Check the intended browser or account before removing saved items.', 'guide' => 'https://booster.io/docs/woocommerce-wishlist/#booster-v10-s19-wishlist-customer-list', 'routes' => array( 'free' => array( 'context-dependent frontend URL; do not invent a product/page ID' ), 'plus' => array( 'context-dependent frontend URL; do not invent a product/page ID' ), 'elite' => array( 'context-dependent frontend URL; do not invent a product/page ID' ) ), 'members' => array( 'free' => array(  ), 'plus' => array(  ), 'elite' => array(  ) ), 'placement' => 'wishlist_frontend', 'member_keys' => array(  ) ) );}
 public static function modules(){return array( 'wishlist' => array( 'Wishlist', 'Save items and share reviews', 'Let shoppers keep items for later, then choose whether to add them to the cart. A wishlist is not an order or a promise to reserve stock.', 'Free and Plus provide the product-page button and wishlist page with fixed wording and appearance. Elite adds archive buttons, editable choices and the separate wishlist-button shortcode. Guest and signed-in lists are different.' ), 'reviews' => array( 'Reviews', 'Save items and share reviews', 'Choose review form fields and eligibility, and inspect or moderate existing reviews. Exports and attachments can contain personal information.', 'Reviews is available in Elite. WooCommerce login, verified-purchase and product review settings can also affect the form.' ), 'sale_flash' => array( 'Sale Flash', 'Show badges and purchase activity', 'Choose wording for sale badges without changing prices or putting products on sale. Product, category and tag choices can override or bypass the default.', 'The global badge and hide choices are available in all editions. Per Product, Per Category and Per Tag overrides are available in Plus and Elite.' ), 'sales_notifications' => array( 'Sales Notifications', 'Show badges and purchase activity', 'Show selected purchase information from orders. Review the details you will disclose before enabling notifications. Saved timing is not a guarantee of immediate or newest-order display.', 'Free and Plus keep the default message and Processing/Completed order selection, with the other limits shown in settings. Elite exposes more message, placement and appearance choices.' ), 'coupon_by_user_role' => array( 'Coupon by User Role', 'Control coupon use', 'Choose which shopper roles cannot use coupons. This changes eligibility, not a coupon discount amount. Booster uses the first current role and its supported role override.', 'All-coupon role restrictions are available in every edition. Per-coupon restrictions and the custom rejection message are available in Plus and Elite.' ), 'coupon_code_generator' => array( 'Coupon Code Generator', 'Control coupon use', 'Suggest a code in an empty new-coupon field. The suggestion is not a published coupon, a reserved code or a discount.', 'Free uses the default CRC32 code format. Plus and Elite can choose the available format and maximum length. Review the coupon itself before publishing.' ), 'url_coupons' => array( 'URL Coupons', 'Control coupon use', 'A visit to a coupon link can apply a coupon, redirect the shopper and, if configured, add products to the cart. It is not a harmless preview link.', 'The coupon parameter is available in every edition. Redirect choices and automatic additions for fixed-product coupons are available in Plus and Elite; Free keeps its default behavior. WooCommerce still validates the coupon.' ) );}
 public static function url(){return admin_url('admin.php?page=wcj-promotions-tasks');}
 public static function allowed($module){$core=WCJ_Job_Store::core();return WCJ_Task_Finder::allowed($module)&&$core&&isset($core->all_modules[$module]);}
 private static function settings_url($module){$ed=WCJ_Sale_Badge_Job::edition();foreach(self::groups() as $g){if($g['module']!==$module){continue;}foreach($g['routes'][$ed]??array() as $route){if(0===strpos($route,'admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&')){return admin_url($route);}}}return self::url();}
 private static function link($url,$label){return '<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="'.esc_url($url).'">'.esc_html($label.' (new tab)').'</a>';}
 public static function render($module='',$selected=array()){
  $ed=WCJ_Sale_Badge_Job::edition();$items=array_filter(self::groups(),static function($g)use($module,$selected,$ed){return (!$module||$module===$g['module'])&&(!$selected||in_array($g['group'],$selected,true))&&isset($g['routes'][$ed])&&self::allowed($g['module']);});
  if(!$items){return;}
  echo '<details class="wcj-promotions-groups"><summary>Promotions and merchandising: settings and help</summary><p>Help and full settings open in a new tab, leaving unsaved edits here. Save any changes there before reloading this page. Opening these help links does not apply a coupon, change a cart, publish a review or send a notification.</p><ul>';
  foreach($items as $g){echo '<li class="wcj-promotions-group" data-promotions-group="'.esc_attr($g['group']).'"><h4>'.esc_html($g['label']).'</h4><p>'.esc_html($g['consequence']).'</p><p>'.esc_html($g['context']).'</p><p>';
   $linked=false;foreach(array_unique($g['routes'][$ed]) as $route){
    if(0===strpos($route,'admin.php?page=wcj-plugins&')||'post-new.php?post_type=shop_coupon'===$route){echo self::link(admin_url($route),'Full settings: '.$g['label']).' | ';$linked=true;}
   }
   if(!$linked){echo self::link(self::settings_url($g['module']),'Module settings').' | ';}
   echo self::link($g['guide'],'Help: '.$g['label']).'</p>';
   if('coupon_editor'===$g['placement']){echo '<p>Choose the intended coupon in the WooCommerce coupon list. Do not publish or redeem a coupon merely to inspect these fields.</p>';}
   elseif('product_editor'===$g['placement']){echo '<p>Choose the intended product in Products, then inspect its Sale Flash box where available.</p>';}
   elseif('reviews_tool'===$g['placement']){echo '<p>Use the Reviews tools button in module settings to open the list. Moderation and export remain separate, deliberate actions.</p>';}
   elseif('product_review_form'===$g['placement']){echo '<p>Inspect an existing product page and the appropriate customer account. This help does not submit a review or upload media.</p>';}
   elseif('wishlist_frontend'===$g['placement']){echo '<p>Inspect your chosen page containing [wcj_wishlist]. The wishlist URL alone does not create that page content.</p>';}
   if($g['members'][$ed]){echo '<details><summary>Settings listed for '.esc_html(ucfirst($ed)).'</summary><ul>';foreach($g['members'][$ed] as $label){echo '<li>'.esc_html($label).'</li>';}echo '</ul><p>Some controls appear only after you save a count, selection or enabled section. The full editor keeps its edition limits and your account permissions.</p></details>';}
   echo '</li>';
  }echo '</ul></details>';
 }
 public static function entry(){if(current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')){echo '<p><a href="'.esc_url(self::url()).'">Promotions and merchandising: choose what to change</a></p>';}}
 public static function register(){if(current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')){add_submenu_page('woocommerce','Promotions and merchandising choices','Promotions and merchandising','manage_woocommerce','wcj-promotions-tasks',array(__CLASS__,'hub'));}}
 public static function hub(){
  if(!current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')){wp_die(esc_html__('Ask an administrator for access.','woocommerce-jetpack'));}
  wp_enqueue_style('wcj-sale-badge-job',wcj_plugin_url().'/assets/css/admin/wcj-sale-badge-job.css',array(),'1.0');
  echo '<div class="wrap wcj-promotions-hub"><h1>Help shoppers choose and return</h1><p>Choose the result you need. A badge changes wording, a wishlist keeps items for later, and coupon rules control eligibility. None of these choices is a promise of a sale or a discount.</p>';
  if(self::allowed('sale_flash')){echo '<p><a class="button button-primary" href="'.esc_url(WCJ_Sale_Badge_Job::url()).'">Change the default sale badge text</a></p>';}
  foreach(array('Save items and share reviews','Show badges and purchase activity','Control coupon use') as $lane){echo '<section><h2>'.esc_html($lane).'</h2>';foreach(self::modules() as $id=>$m){if($lane!==$m[1]||!self::allowed($id)){continue;}$s=WCJ_Job_Store::read_state('wcj_'.$id.'_enabled');$flag=!$s['exists']?'Off (not switched on)':('yes'===$s['raw']?'On':('no'===$s['raw']?'Off':'Unrecognized saved value'));echo '<div data-promotions-module="'.esc_attr($id).'"><h3>'.esc_html($m[0]).'</h3><p>'.esc_html($m[2]).'</p><p>'.esc_html($m[3]).'</p><p>'.esc_html('Saved module switch: '.$flag.'. Settings can be saved while a module is Off; saved choices alone do not mean shoppers see them.').'</p>';self::render($id);echo '</div>';}echo '</section>';}
  if('elite'!==WCJ_Sale_Badge_Job::edition()){echo '<p>Reviews form and moderation tools in this family are available in Elite.</p>';}
  echo '<details><summary>Switching off and resetting</summary><p>Use full settings to change module switches. Record the current choices before using Reset: resetting removes this module\'s saved settings, not just the last edit, and is not this task\'s Undo. Review any products, coupons, reviews or customer lists separately; turning a module off is not a reversal of their past actions.</p></details></div>';
 }
 public static function boxes($type,$post){
  if(!current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')||!is_object($post)||!current_user_can('edit_post',$post->ID)){return;}
  if('product'===$type&&self::allowed('sale_flash')){add_meta_box('wcj-promotions-product-help','Sale badges: help and consequences',array(__CLASS__,'product_help'),'product','normal','low');}
  elseif('shop_coupon'===$type&&(self::allowed('coupon_by_user_role')||self::allowed('coupon_code_generator'))){add_meta_box('wcj-promotions-coupon-help','Coupon codes and roles: help',array(__CLASS__,'coupon_help'),'shop_coupon','normal','low');}
  elseif(in_array($type,array('post','page'),true)&&self::allowed('wishlist')&&preg_match('/\[wcj_wishlist(?:_button)?(?:[\s\]])/',(string)$post->post_content)){add_meta_box('wcj-promotions-wishlist-help','Wishlist page help',array(__CLASS__,'wishlist_help'),$type,'side','low');}
 }
 public static function product_help($post){if(current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')&&current_user_can('edit_post',$post->ID)){self::render('sale_flash',array('sale_flash--product-editor'));}}
 public static function coupon_help($post){if(current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')&&current_user_can('edit_post',$post->ID)){self::render('',array('coupon_by_user_role--coupon-editor','coupon_code_generator--coupon-editor'));}}
 public static function wishlist_help($post){if(current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')&&current_user_can('edit_post',$post->ID)){self::render('wishlist',array('wishlist--page','wishlist--customer-list'));}}
 public static function screen_help(){
  if(!current_user_can('manage_woocommerce')||!self::allowed('reviews')){return;}$screen=get_current_screen();
  if($screen&&isset($_GET['page'],$_GET['tab'])&&is_string($_GET['page'])&&is_string($_GET['tab'])&&'wcj-tools'===$_GET['page']&&'wcj_reviews'===$_GET['tab']){self::render('reviews',array('reviews--review-list'));}
 }
}
add_action('admin_menu',array('WCJ_Promotions_Groups','register'),99);
add_action('add_meta_boxes',array('WCJ_Promotions_Groups','boxes'),40,2);
add_action('admin_notices',array('WCJ_Promotions_Groups','screen_help'),40);
